text:
Two weeks ago, if you heard Jensen Huang would be out at Nvidia, a midterm sweep would hit data centers, and a major tech outage would follow, would you have guessed the market sits 2% from all-time highs?

@jam_croissant: “No, of course not.”

That’s the power of structural flows.

